                    <div class="project-content"><div class="project-topline"><span>01 / COMPILER</span><span>MLIR · RISC-V</span></div>
                    <h3>RICE Dialect for Torch-MLIR</h3>
                    <p>A custom MLIR dialect for Transformer workloads on RISC-V, with high-level Attention and SwiGLU operations lowered through Linalg to vector intrinsics.</p>
                    <a class="project-link" href="https://github.com/BrainSeek-Lab/torch-mlir-rice" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">View repository <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
